        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "可就在今年，四大满贯男单半决赛，十六个席位，没有一个单反。据统计，这是一八七七年第一届温网以来的第一次。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "5ed96dc956795e2a4a641f965c6b37c17879a44d9e545280843ad2c1550fc31a",
      "words_sha256": "88535c487c068ec969e2b6b7176b1ff484cf7920d1673ed21ad2280451284190"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:372d23189392b8b32921f4bd3aa0bdbb4e9cca81f20c4914cc5ecf08236a2088",
      "request_id": "372d23189392b8b32921f4bd3aa0bdbb4e9cca81f20c4914cc5ecf08236a2088",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b05c6257236e2e2397f5dda045899da1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第三，从小学的就是双反。费德勒说：现在大多数教练自己就是双反，而且教孩子双反，要容易得多。他自己的一个孩子，正在从双反改成单反，正在体会这有多难。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "bde66a08a86cf05ee44ec0a2b6aade2e5ace43e486d860ed5cd8cbaae718e1dc",
      "words_sha256": "796c87d3c6214f5fcc15d39f0f19e2d65619ff7765e0a0a1d03150d0790bf771"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:4e46dfb6335487684d8692a3228747a4d4b64902106d3164392b622c62e24ace",
      "request_id": "4e46dfb6335487684d8692a3228747a4d4b64902106d3164392b622c62e24ace",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d1e9e2b825ee1ac91ed3e98832b86383",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "大满贯男单半决赛，149年来，首次没有单反。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "0ee84c483901f78fa706a772458d17bcdd5187691bbab031a6c32a1449b0ba62",
      "words_sha256": "17641144f765085d9510be6bf8a489b0de892a32a018a2c2faea1320e842d92d"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:54ceb82a0214bc4dfea39692ba57e3e935595ce68a222fc6d6be6e15bb9bafd2",
      "request_id": "54ceb82a0214bc4dfea39692ba57e3e935595ce68a222fc6d6be6e15bb9bafd2",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5e9c5154532ead6b5e8a8045928b3780",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第一，怕高球。弹到肩膀那么高的上旋球，一只手很难发力。纳达尔对费德勒，用的就是这一招，一拍一拍压向他的反手。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7c5ce67dff53a835132f18a42dc9a237604648e9952dc5163a91c9167dca28b3",
      "words_sha256": "0191cbe064914c6d5d788202263aee9d212276182362d40221bef7a5cc3dcee9"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:63e77f0f2c4eb3548c66d1d3091c8e6e5b52cf934064601afcc1a7590959d01c",
      "request_id": "63e77f0f2c4eb3548c66d1d3091c8e6e5b52cf934064601afcc1a7590959d01c",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c533d61dcc10d114fa611a97903e3036",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "一九七三年，ATP 公布第一份排名。前十名里九个人打单反，唯一的例外，是康纳斯。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "1281030792de1f6d1c960ac11bffe91d4c6279b819b75e18045dd06d1d9acf10",
      "words_sha256": "4cab4ea01f16d654b26a06073075cff1ab22282f95c7a3de5161eb85987ca9e0"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:7e9fd30449859f7a8f4e676f9c4ddb63ace33262d56ebc73103119a8a6ff0cf9",
      "request_id": "7e9fd30449859f7a8f4e676f9c4ddb63ace33262d56ebc73103119a8a6ff0cf9",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e335b782e9a7a797eefb14f3e9dace5b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "男子大满贯最后一个单反冠军，是二零二零年美网的蒂姆。决赛他先丢两盘，逆转了兹维列夫。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d837df52b8e21a18afc0c40897ce49bc94e222c0d2488e5e0f141ac7b33d29c7",
      "words_sha256": "6e8d75c43f1875cac674e2a06b99570b26651edbb5cc397d0e06b63c7ae861cd"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b7cd8a5cbf20a1512ce57fe8fa1fb2a9b85948a777ae1f3fb577c0326d57621f",
      "request_id": "b7cd8a5cbf20a1512ce57fe8fa1fb2a9b85948a777ae1f3fb577c0326d57621f",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d5d250c2017ebf3f897fce6edc1bfc56",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "单反好看，一只手把整个身体甩出去，打得平，打得狠。瓦林卡就靠这一拍，抢下了三座大满贯。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "1bbba23fa6cd7f0e2bf34b62bc6583a1120b9cddcc61f5dfed56e6937b3bfccd",
      "words_sha256": "ee4ed6cea532c5171e89b5f88e7373c5a993c938476bdddc1f1f035237d62822"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "616692b87da2908dc3f1329f9b0b96dfe70a4a15dbfe38b4d311e4b61e700511",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:baca34552de6d9e47781cc34ed8093b1e4f85d29fd3612f820104fa551a70b65",
      "request_id": "baca34552de6d9e47781cc34ed8093b1e4f85d29fd3612f820104fa551a70b65",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c8d86901bf6e58f9f13210e63f1de7cf",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这一记单反直线，让瓦林卡拿下二零一五年法网。十月二十七日，四十一岁的他在巴塞尔退役了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "a4d41c0fba0111779c335aa3adfcae41b53c4c3d48678b90ad664330c259e932",
      "words_sha256": "ad77e96c3f958d7e80e35dc0a195d5a599c47d54ef4e40ac9e622970400de195"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:c000b027e98645478ded81fed1360cc61152364ac438ae13c848224ada658758",
      "request_id": "c000b027e98645478ded81fed1360cc61152364ac438ae13c848224ada658758",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ca9ce3305d517aa70ef8fbde6beea096",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "五十年后，二零二四年二月，西西帕斯跌出前十。ATP 前十，第一次一个单反都没有。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "62a17ce3d9b1d9bd1a2a8395722b8c63e58444b6fa543cdf45266d24403d32f8",
      "words_sha256": "f60a9f56900b263964037e0cb1e3d647830e59341924e6e901eab204b72589a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:c54da9413a4f399af2aaeb0f44e277be6204651206d066904dcf6e60080fc8d1",
      "request_id": "c54da9413a4f399af2aaeb0f44e277be6204651206d066904dcf6e60080fc8d1",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "06df47d83becfcd964708c8a3e4683a1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "费德勒说，单反不会消失，它还会回来。瓦林卡走了，你身边，还有人打单反吗？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "5a18bb9d9a3502b8ad3c17708eda674914510979142238c70682871e2a5303ad",
      "words_sha256": "a5fd38039595e18f8f2cecb337d204adbeede37778dc223a3e4ba44071c98bc9"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:d9c2571aa532b4a84d93f27e1ffab7ad5fc241d80090283e5ac3497b8351f777",
      "request_id": "d9c2571aa532b4a84d93f27e1ffab7ad5fc241d80090283e5ac3497b8351f777",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "2014baedb331d5b21beb171e8399179f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "最后的单反。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d61ab9758c78887152f40004e50e201bdb5e9be528bd09b46b075fb3e9cae660",
      "words_sha256": "0dbca666f97601c5139ecfea22b55b3f3c9e186e2f669efbdd3f63fab64220a2"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:e14200614c77e0b42e74c3b11cef2b7068652bb3f54aa33d5cd86df50ab00196",
      "request_id": "e14200614c77e0b42e74c3b11cef2b7068652bb3f54aa33d5cd86df50ab00196",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ce674258fecd886e5d1a3a19f4e5092b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二，来不及。谢尔顿这一发，时速两百零八公里，西西帕斯单手伸出去，只能把球挡回来。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f94599aa11262325fd23038143203203cf3fe9607826ed85d4b203ffcac6d06d",
      "words_sha256": "c9b1999fce3a88d709f1e8ca7c99e1434816bedad2dc5f0db963825f5714b1ac"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:e14937c0062cb5b0f64f98bab77ab1a389e7b192631a49206a33cf34a12c4ee4",
      "request_id": "e14937c0062cb5b0f64f98bab77ab1a389e7b192631a49206a33cf34a12c4ee4",
